{"id":"n26502-1-5","stage":2,"title":"부채 · 扇子","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26502-1-5-1","ko":"여기 왜 이렇게 덥지? 에어컨이 없나?","zh":"这里怎么这么热啊？没有空调吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덥지?","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"에어컨이","meaning":"空调","explanation":"에어컨：空调；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"에어컨","audio":"/audio/4641fbad3b128eddb044.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62514","senseId":"1","lemma":"에어컨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없나?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"4641fbad3b128edd","term":"에어컨","zh":"空调","audio":"/audio/4641fbad3b128eddb044.mp3","entryId":"62514","definition":"可以吹出凉快的空气、调节湿度的装置。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ea7020e2807e9eddd69e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26502-1-5-2","ko":"더워? 내가 부채를 부쳐 줄게.","zh":"热吗？我帮你扇扇子吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"더워?","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부채를","meaning":"扇子","explanation":"부채：扇子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"부채","audio":"/audio/4cd483a22d9d32d7fb6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26502","senseId":"1","lemma":"부채","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부쳐","meaning":"扇风，扇","explanation":"부치다：扇风，扇；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"부치다","audio":"/audio/b3fb1e23969565512601.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59653","senseId":"1","lemma":"부치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄게.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"4cd483a22d9d32d7","term":"부채","zh":"扇子","audio":"/audio/4cd483a22d9d32d7fb6f.mp3","entryId":"26502","definition":"手持扇动用于生风的工具。","pronunciation":["부채"]},{"id":"b3fb1e2396956551","term":"부치다","zh":"扇风，扇","audio":"/audio/b3fb1e23969565512601.mp3","entryId":"59653","definition":"用扇子或宽幅纸张等东西挥起风来。","pronunciation":["부치다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/846b771fa79c0c8cb99f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.33,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26502","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":78,"sequenceScore":2.1567,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这里怎么这么热啊？没有空调吗？","热吗？我帮你扇扇子吧。","去市政府的话，要在哪一站下车呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这里怎么这么热啊？没有空调吗？","热吗？我帮你扇扇子吧。","去市政府的话，要在哪一站下车呢？"],"answer":1}]}
